      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "The integration of practical gunplay effects with character-driven drama in Desperado created a new template for action storytelling. Films like <a href=\"/movie/245891\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"245891\">John Wick</a> (2014) would later adopt similar approaches to gun-fu choreography, while the cultural specificity of the film's Mexican setting paved the way for works like <a href=\"/movie/273481\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"273481\">Sicario</a> (2015) and <a href=\"/movie/6977\" class=\"movie-title\" data-tmdb-id=\"6977\">No Country for Old Men</a> (2007)."
      }
